<title>INDONESIA: Bunas 1995-96 net up to 30.22 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Bunas 1995-96 net up to 30.22 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to November 30, 1996</p>
<p>				     (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			    30.22    vs    20.19</p>
<p>    Revenues			     173.80    vs   109.25</p>
<p>    Expenses			     131.91    vs    84.18</p>
<p>    EPS (in rupiah)			524     vs	350</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			41.89    vs    25.07</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		   51.58    vs    28.11</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Bunas Finance Indonesia is a finance company and a member of Indonesia's Ongko Group, whose business interests also include banking and ceramics.</p>
</text>
